/*문진 자료에서 심뇌혈관 기저병력이나 기저병력으로 약물치료 인경우 제외*/
DATA A.BFC_HMDT_HA4; SET A.BFC_HMDT_HA3;
IF Q_PHX_DX_STK =1 THEN DELETE;    /*과거력/뇌졸중(중풍)/진단여부*/
IF Q_PHX_DX_HTDZ=1 THEN DELETE; /*과거력/심장병(심근경색/협심증)/진단여부*/
IF Q_PHX_TX_HTDZ=1 THEN DELETE;
IF Q_PHX_TX_HTN=1 THEN DELETE;

/*가족력*/
IF Q_FHX_STK="." THEN Q_FHX_STK=9;         /*뇌졸중*/
IF Q_FHX_HTDZ="." THEN Q_FHX_HTDZ=9; /*심장병*/
IF Q_FHX_HTN ="." THEN Q_FHX_HTN=9;   /*고혈압*/
IF Q_FHX_DM="." THEN Q_FHX_DM=9;      /*당뇨*/
IF Q_FHX_ETC="." THEN Q_FHX_ETC=9;     /*가족력 기타 (암포함)*/

DROP  Q_PHX_DX_HTN	 Q_PHX_DX_DM	 Q_PHX_DX_DLD	Q_PHX_DX_PTB	
Q_PHX_DX_ETC Q_PHX_TX_STK Q_PHX_TX_HTDZ	 Q_PHX_TX_HTN Q_PHX_TX_DM	   
Q_PHX_TX_DLD Q_PHX_TX_PTB	Q_PHX_TX_ETC;
RUN;

